1. `cd /dayjs && npx jest test/plugin/weekYear.test.js test/plugin/weekOfYear.test.js` → **2 suites / 10 tests passed**.
2. `cd /dayjs && npx jest` → **56 suites / 524 tests passed, 0 failures**.
3. `npx eslint src/plugin/weekYear/index.js` → clean.
